<body>
    <h1>White label Operationalization</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><br></p>
<p><span><span><strong>Objective:</strong> White label feature enables bran=
ding of Compass new experience to the client firms logo and colors.</span><=
/span></p>
<p><strong>Feature Details:</strong></p>
<p><span><span>Following can be </span><span>modified</span><span> for firm=
s under </span><span>white-labeling</span></span><span> for each firm. The =
configurations need to be done for each environment separately if needed.</=
span></p>
<ul>
 <li><span><span>EN firm logo</span></span><span> </span></li>
 <li>FR firm logo<span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span></li>
 <li>Background color<span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span></li>
 <li>Text color<span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span></li>
 <li>Border color<span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span></li>
 <li>Accent color<span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span></li>
 <li>Accent text color</li>
</ul>
<p>Out of Scope- Legay modules (R2 SSO and Broadridge), Data Export (extern=
al applications that open in new browser tab), Tools</p>
<p><span><span class=3D"SCXW106060145 BCX8" style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span =
class=3D"WACImageContainer NoPadding DragDrop BlobObject SCXW106060145 BCX8=
"><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manua=
l-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" height=
=3D"262" src=3D"ed7e01986e2ab95bde7377e29325d45738fe83e592c1605a06903a1b38b=
9ec1d" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1988797375/image-2024-9-11_2=
3-18-21.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1726111101497&amp;api=3Dv2" =
data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1988797379" =
data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment"=
 data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2024-9-11_23-18-21.png" data-b=
ase-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/=
png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1988797375" data-linked-resource-=
container-version=3D"12" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></spa=
n></span>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>The white label colors also get updated for Walk-me by default.&nbsp;</p=
>
<p>Note: There is no option of excluding walk-me from white labeling or upd=
ate colors only for walk-me</p>
<p><strong><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embed=
ded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"fals=
e" height=3D"262" src=3D"b13febd94be974f43dce2260274cbe7dd6c090ee6f031dee46=
3bebf03361e9d9" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1988797375/image-20=
24-9-13_15-58-7.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1726257487331&amp;ap=
i=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1988=
809694" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"att=
achment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2024-9-13_15-58-7.png"=
 data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D=
"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1988797375" data-linked-re=
source-container-version=3D"12" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></spa=
n></strong></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Access Control</strong></p>
<p><span><span>Following roles have access to&nbsp;</span><span>modify</spa=
n><span> the colors and use the </span><span>white labeling</span><span> fe=
ature </span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>
<ul>
 <li><span><span>Manage Firm and User</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><strong>Specifications</strong></p>
<p><span><span>All image&nbsp;</span><span>file types are accepted for logo=
s:</span><span> </span><span>png</span><span>, jpeg, </span><span>svg</span=
><span>, bmp, gif, </span><span>tif</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><strong>Steps to update logo and colors:&nbsp;</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li><span><span>Select the firm for which we need to implement branding ch=
anges.</span></span></li>
 <li><span><span>Go to Branding under Manage Firm</span></span></li>
 <li><span><span>Click on the logo box and upload the image provided by cli=
ent</span></span><span> </span></li>
 <li>If only EN or FR logo is updated, then it would get applied for both l=
anguages<span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span></li>
 <li>Click on the colors and set the colors using either &nbsp;- RGB , HSL =
or HEX color codes<span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span></li>
 <li>Click on Update Brand button to implement selected colors<span style=
=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span></li>
 <li>Use Clear Brand to go back to default colors<span style=3D"letter-spac=
ing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><span><span class=3D"SCXW247082557 BCX8" style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><span =
